---
import DocLayout from '../layouts/DocLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';

const sections = [
  { id: 'what', title: 'What FirePath is' },
  { id: 'advice', title: 'Not financial advice' },
  { id: 'account', title: 'Your account' },
  { id: 'plans', title: 'Free and Pro plans' },
  { id: 'use', title: 'Acceptable use' },
  { id: 'ip', title: 'Intellectual property' },
  { id: 'liability', title: 'Limitation of liability' },
  { id: 'changes', title: 'Changes to these terms' },
  { id: 'law', title: 'Governing law' },
  { id: 'contact', title: 'Contact' },
];
const glance = [
  { icon: 'book', title: 'Educational only', text: 'Nothing on FirePath is financial advice. Projections are illustrative.' },
  { icon: 'user', title: '18 and over', text: 'You need to be 18 or older to create an account.' },
  { icon: 'card', title: 'Cancel any time', text: 'The free tools need no account. Pro is $6/month after a 7-day trial. Cancelling takes effect at the end of your billing period.' },
  { icon: 'scale', title: 'Australian law', text: 'These terms are governed by the laws of New South Wales.' },
];
const check = { size: 13, stroke: 2.6 };
---
<DocLayout
  title="Terms of Service | FirePath"
  description="The terms for using FirePath, an educational financial independence tool for Australians. Not financial advice."
  path="/terms"
  eyebrow="Legal"
  heading="Terms of"
  accent="Service"
  lead="These terms govern your use of FirePath (firepath.pro). By using FirePath, you agree to these terms. If you don't agree, please don't use the service."
  updated="October 2026"
  readMins={3}
  sections={sections}
  glance={glance}
  glanceNote="A quick summary — the full terms below are what apply."
>
  <div class="doc-notice">
    <span class="doc-notice-label"><Icon name="flame" size={14}/>Important</span>
    <p><strong>FirePath is an educational tool only.</strong> Nothing on this platform constitutes financial advice. All projections are illustrative and based solely on the numbers you enter. Always consult a licensed financial adviser before making financial decisions.</p>
  </div>

  <section class="doc-section" id="what" data-doc-section style="margin-top: 40px;">
    <h2>What FirePath is</h2>
    <p>FirePath is an educational financial independence calculator. It helps you understand your financial freedom number (the amount you'd need invested to cover your spending, drawing it down slowly over 30 years or more) and provides illustrative projections of when you might reach it based on your inputs.</p>
    <p>FirePath is not a financial planning service, investment platform, or licensed financial adviser. It does not account for your full financial situation, tax obligations, insurance, or individual circumstances beyond what you enter.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-section" id="advice" data-doc-section>
    <h2>Not financial advice</h2>
    <p>All content, calculations, AI insights, and projections provided by FirePath are for educational and informational purposes only. They are not financial advice, investment advice, tax advice, or any other form of professional advice.</p>
    <p>FirePath's projections assume simplified models (such as the 4% safe withdrawal rate) that may not reflect your actual outcomes. Past investment performance is not a reliable indicator of future returns. Your actual financial situation may differ materially from any projection shown.</p>
    <div class="doc-aside"><p>FirePath and its creator are not licensed financial advisers and are not regulated by ASIC or any other financial authority. Use this tool as a starting point for thinking about your finances — not as the basis for any financial decision.</p></div>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-section" id="account" data-doc-section>
    <h2>Your account</h2>
    <ul class="doc-list is-yes">
      <li><span class="doc-list-mark"><Icon name="check" {...check}/></span><span>You must be 18 or older to create an account. Accounts are for FirePath Pro subscribers, including during the free trial.</span></li>
      <li><span class="doc-list-mark"><Icon name="check" {...check}/></span><span>You are responsible for keeping your login credentials secure.</span></li>
      <li><span class="doc-list-mark"><Icon name="check" {...check}/></span><span>You are responsible for all activity that occurs under your account.</span></li>
      <li><span class="doc-list-mark"><Icon name="check" {...check}/></span><span>You must provide accurate information when creating your account.</span></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-section" id="plans" data-doc-section>
    <h2>Free and Pro plans</h2>
    <p>FirePath's free tools work without an account. Accounts are part of FirePath Pro ($6/month), which saves your plan and adds super and tax modelling, Ask FirePath, AI insights and the Journey dashboard. Pro starts with a 7-day free trial; a card is needed to start the trial and is first charged on day 8.</p>
    <p>Pro subscriptions are billed monthly through Stripe. You can cancel at any time — cancellation takes effect at the end of your current billing period. We do not offer refunds for partial months.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-section" id="use" data-doc-section>
    <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>You agree not to:</p>
    <ul class="doc-list is-no">
      <li><span class="doc-list-mark"><Icon name="cross" size={12} stroke={2.6}/></span><span>Use FirePath for any unlawful purpose.</span></li>
      <li><span class="doc-list-mark"><Icon name="cross" size={12} stroke={2.6}/></span><span>Attempt to reverse engineer, scrape, or copy FirePath's code or content.</span></li>
      <li><span class="doc-list-mark"><Icon name="cross" size={12} stroke={2.6}/></span><span>Use FirePath to provide financial advice to others as if it were your own professional advice.</span></li>
      <li><span class="doc-list-mark"><Icon name="cross" size={12} stroke={2.6}/></span><span>Attempt to compromise the security or integrity of the platform.</span></li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-section" id="ip" data-doc-section>
    <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>All content, design, code, and branding on FirePath is owned by its creator. You may not reproduce, distribute, or create derivative works without written permission.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-section" id="liability" data-doc-section>
    <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
    <p>To the maximum extent permitted by Australian law, FirePath and its creator are not liable for any loss or damage arising from your use of this service, including any financial decisions you make based on information provided by FirePath.</p>
    <p>FirePath is provided "as is" without warranties of any kind, including accuracy, completeness, or fitness for a particular purpose.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-section" id="changes" data-doc-section>
    <h2>Changes to these terms</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms from time to time. We'll update the date at the top of this page when we do. Continued use of FirePath after changes means you accept the updated terms.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-section" id="law" data-doc-section>
    <h2>Governing law</h2>
    <p>These terms are governed by the laws of New South Wales, Australia. Any disputes will be subject to the jurisdiction of Australian courts.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="doc-section" id="contact" data-doc-section>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about these terms? Email us at <a href="mailto:hello@firepath.pro">hello@firepath.pro</a></p>
  </section>
</DocLayout>
